{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794535022944,"sessionID":"ses_e2d61a4abffeh9vQudGvgT5Z1T","part":{"partID":"prt_1d29f5e1d001xgPPtY79T07Quy","sessionID":"ses_e2d61a4abffeh9vQudGvgT5Z1T","messageID":"msg_1d29f40e5001WVrYncXmlgtaDj","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8b1797d1e0cd6bfd","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/002-command-inventory-and-risk-metadata/tasks.md","offset":16,"limit":30},"output":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/002-command-inventory-and-risk-metadata/tasks.md, lines 16-45\n16: <!-- ANCHOR:notation -->\n17: ## Task Notation\n18: \n19: | Prefix | Meaning |\n20: |--------|---------|\n21: | `[ ]` | Pending |\n22: | `[x]` | Completed |\n23: | `[P]` | Parallelizable |\n24: | `[B]` | Blocked |\n25: \n26: **Task Format**: `T### [P?] Description (file path). Verify: <command> prints <expected output>`\n27: \n28: Every command runs from the repository root unless a task says otherwise. `ADV` is `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime`. `SK` is `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill`. `D` is `$ADV/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs`. `G` is `$ADV/scripts/command-bridges/command-bridges.generated.json`. `S` is this packet's `scratch/` folder.\n29: <!-- /ANCHOR:notation -->\n30: \n31: ---\n32: \n33: <!-- ANCHOR:phase-1 -->\n34: ## Phase 1: Setup\n35: \n36: - [x] T001 Confirm the deriver is fresh before any edit (`$G`). Verify: `node $D --check | jq -r .status` prints `fresh`.\n37: - [x] T002 Confirm the contract gate and record the contract test's state before any edit (`$SK/scripts/tests/skill-root-metadata-contract.test.cjs`). Verify: `node $SK/scripts/ci-skill-root-metadata.cjs | tail -1` prints `checked=14 passed=14 failed=0 fixed=0`, and `node $SK/scripts/tests/skill-root-metadata-contract.test.cjs` fails at `testFleetDiscoveryUsesTheAuthoredMarker` because its expected roster lacks `system-skilled-doctor`. That failure predates this phase.\n38: - [x] T003 Confirm routing is at the phase 1 baseline (`$ADV/tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts`). Verify: in `$ADV`, `npx vitest run tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts` reports 4 passed, and `node scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-scorer-eval-baseline.mjs | jq -c '[.metrics.full_corpus_top1.correct,.metrics.holdout_top1.correct,.metrics.ambiguity_top1.correct,.metrics.gold_none_false_fire.value]'` prints `[158,50,20,5]`.\n39: - [x] T004 Save the baseline's routing parts for the later comparison (`$S/baseline-before.json`). Verify: `jq -c '{rows,metrics,commands,unreachable}' $ADV/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json > $S/baseline-before.json` exits 0 and `jq '.rows | length' $S/baseline-before.json` prints 175.\n40: <!-- /ANCHOR:phase-1 -->\n41: \n42: ---\n43: \n44: <!-- ANCHOR:phase-2 -->\n45: ## Phase 2: Implementation\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 46]","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":true},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/002-command-inventory-and-risk-metadata/tasks.md, lines 16-45\n16: <!-- ANCHOR:notation -->\n17: ## Task Notation\n18: \n19: | Prefix | Meaning |\n20: |--------|---------|\n21: | `[ ]` | Pending |\n22: | `[x]` | Completed |\n23: | `[P]` | Parallelizable |\n24: | `[B]` | Blocked |\n25: \n26: **Task Format**: `T### [P?] Description (file path). Verify: <command> prints <expected output>`\n27: \n28: Every command runs from the repository root unless a task says otherwise. `ADV` is `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime`. `SK` is `.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-skill`. `D` is `$ADV/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs`. `G` is `$ADV/scripts/command-bridges/command-bridges.generated.json`. `S` is this packet's `scratch/` folder.\n29: <!-- /ANCHOR:notation -->\n30: \n31: ---\n32: \n33: <!-- ANCHOR:phase-1 -->\n34: ## Phase 1: Setup\n35: \n36: - [x] T001 Confirm the deriver is fresh before any edit (`$G`). Verify: `node $D --check | jq -r .status` prints `fresh`.\n37: - [x] T002 Confirm the contract gate and record the contract test's state before any edit (`$SK/scripts/tests/skill-root-metadata-contract.test.cjs`). Verify: `node $SK/scripts/ci-skill-root-metadata.cjs | tail -1` prints `checked=14 passed=14 failed=0 fixed=0`, and `node $SK/scripts/tests/skill-root-metadata-contract.test.cjs` fails at `testFleetDiscoveryUsesTheAuthoredMarker` because its expected roster lacks `system-skilled-doctor`. That failure predates this phase.\n38: - [x] T003 Confirm routing is at the phase 1 baseline (`$ADV/tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts`). Verify: in `$ADV`, `npx vitest run tests/command-routing-slice.vitest.ts` reports 4 passed, and `node scripts/routing-accuracy/capture-scorer-eval-baseline.mjs | jq -c '[.metrics.full_corpus_top1.correct,.metrics.holdout_top1.correct,.metrics.ambiguity_top1.correct,.metrics.gold_none_false_fire.value]'` prints `[158,50,20,5]`.\n39: - [x] T004 Save the baseline's routing parts for the later comparison (`$S/baseline-before.json`). Verify: `jq -c '{rows,metrics,commands,unreachable}' $ADV/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-routing-baseline.json > $S/baseline-before.json` exits 0 and `jq '.rows | length' $S/baseline-before.json` prints 175.\n40: <!-- /ANCHOR:phase-1 -->\n41: \n42: ---\n43: \n44: <!-- ANCHOR:phase-2 -->\n45: ## Phase 2: Implementation\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 46]"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing