 Michel Kerkmeester <82775228+MichelKerkmeester@users.noreply.github.com>\nDate:   Thu Oct 15 20:10:17 2026 +0200\n\n    feat(system-skill-advisor): guide setup and health prompts to the doctor commands\n    \n    A prompt like \"help me set up skilled\" or \"check my environment\n    variables\" now surfaces a runnable /doctor:x line. The doctor bridges\n    are generated from the doctor route manifest, a matching skill keeps\n    first place with the doctor command shown as a second line, the Python\n    fallback routes typed /doctor commands only and an unmatched setup\n    prompt gets a /doctor:setup hint. Adds the read-only /doctor:setup\n    command, playbook scenarios and a feature catalog entry. No existing\n    routing prompt changed outcome.\n    \n    Spec: system-skill-advisor/035-doctor-command-routing\n    Commit-Id: 0011375\n\ndiff --git a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/scoring-compatibility.json b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/scoring-compatibility.json\nindex 85ea44a452..a77034b37d 100644\n--- a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/scoring-compatibility.json\n+++ b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/scoring-compatibility.json\n@@ -118,6 +118,96 @@\n         \"create test playbook\",\n         \"testing playbook\"\n       ]\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"inventoryId\": \"command-doctor-setup\",\n+      \"order\": 5,\n+      \"id\": \"command-doctor-setup\",\n+      \"description\": \"\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"inventoryId\": \"command-doctor-env\",\n+      \"order\": 6,\n+      \"id\": \"command-doctor-env\",\n+      \"description\": \"\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"inventoryId\": \"command-doctor-git-hooks\",\n+      \"order\": 7,\n+      \"id\": \"command-doctor-git-hooks\",\n+      \"description\": \"\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"inventoryId\": \"command-doctor-runtime-mirrors\",\n+      \"order\": 8,\n+     