{"type":"text","timestamp":1794535302307,"sessionID":"ses_e2d61a4abffeh9vQudGvgT5Z1T","part":{"id":"prt_1d2a38ec9001r9czsnd4KZIVHb","sessionID":"ses_e2d61a4abffeh9vQudGvgT5Z1T","messageID":"msg_1d2a383bc001znZY4ujSTBQztw","type":"text","text":"T020 is done and verified.\n\n**What I did**\n\nAdded `command-doctor-skill-advisor-embedder` to both hand lists in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/scoring-compatibility.json`, copying the four-key shape of the router-reach rows: typescript `order: 40`, python `order: 51`. Those are the next free orders after `command-doctor-overlay-repin` (39/50), which matches how the previous doctor bridge was appended. Then I ran the deriver, which regenerated its four marked files.\n\n**Files on disk**\n\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/scoring-compatibility.json` (hand edit, +12 lines)\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/command-bridges.generated.json` (regenerated)\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/projection.ts` (regenerated)\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/skill_advisor.py` (regenerated)\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` (regenerated)\n\n**Verify output**\n\n```\n$ node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/command-bridges/derive-command-bridges.cjs --check\n{\n  \"status\": \"fresh\",\n  \"counts\": {\n    \"commandMetadata\": 27,\n    \"doctorRoutes\": 36,\n    \"generated\": 63,\n    \"typescriptActive\": 46,\n    \"pythonActive\": 52\n  },\n  \"changed\": []\n}\nEXIT=0\n\n$ jq -c '[.commandPolicies | group_by(.command)[] | (map(.policy) | if index(\"ask\") then \"ask\" elif index(\"start\") then \"start\" else \"run\" end)] | group_by(.) | map({(.[0]): length}) | add' .../command-bridges.generated.json\n{\"ask\":17,\"run\":7,\"start\":20}\nEXIT=0\n```\n\nBoth expected strings appear and both exits are 0.\n\n**Notes**\n\n- The regenerated entry is active in both runtimes: `name: \"/doctor:skill-advisor embedder\"`, all six manifest trigger phrases as keywords, policy `ask` (mutates), and an `embeddingText` built from the router sentence plus the route phrases.\n- The generation also shifted the auto-activated standalone rows up by one (`command-prompt-improve` 40→41, `command-speckit-*` likewise), because the generator starts standalone orders past the highest hand order. This is the same behaviour the previous append at 39/50 produced, not a new effect.\n- I ran no tests: T020 names none. I did not tick the checkbox in `tasks.md`.\n- Uncommitted changes only, in worktree branch `worktrees/352-command-surfacing-research`. The scoped diff contains no comment text, so no spec path or task id was introduced.\n\nKnown residual risk: none known. Nothing is blocked on you.","time":{"start":1794535296713,"end":1794535302307}}}
